373
00:18:10,150 --> 00:18:12,750
that dwarf might be fine

374
00:18:12,750 --> 00:18:14,890
but will lios be able to hold it down

375
00:18:14,890 --> 00:18:22,670
when the surface warps raise the pan

376
00:18:22,670 --> 00:18:25,750
try not to spill anything

377
00:18:25,750 --> 00:18:30,230
heads up

378
00:18:30,230 --> 00:18:43,350
it's so powerful

379
00:18:43,350 --> 00:18:52,090
lios

380
00:18:52,090 --> 00:19:04,010
namori

381
00:19:04,010 --> 00:19:17,750
no

382
00:19:17,750 --> 00:19:26,470
all right

383
00:19:26,470 --> 00:19:27,470
that's it

384
00:19:27,470 --> 00:19:29,230
we got this

385
00:19:29,230 --> 00:19:31,230
on the fire

386
00:19:31,230 --> 00:19:31,830
now

387
00:19:31,830 --> 00:19:57,790
yes you did it

388
00:19:57,790 --> 00:20:00,430
amazing truly barbaric strength

389
00:20:00,430 --> 00:20:01,830
namari

390
00:20:01,830 --> 00:20:04,010
thank you so much

391
00:20:04,010 --> 00:20:05,410
you too lios

392
