398
00:20:26,350 --> 00:20:28,330
don't you know

399
00:20:28,330 --> 00:20:32,330
eating foods that help with absorption is the basics of nutrition

400
00:20:32,330 --> 00:20:33,130
so does that

401
00:20:33,130 --> 00:20:34,070
so does that mean

402
00:20:34,070 --> 00:20:36,510
let's get cooking

403
00:20:36,510 --> 00:20:40,550
potatoes carrots onions

404
00:20:40,550 --> 00:20:42,770
peel the skin from the tentacles

405
00:20:42,770 --> 00:20:44,770
